    65	    /** The charge on a claim whose figure is `figure`: for each full 30 days it is overdue, the late percent in force
    66	     *  on that boundary date (its due-by plus its grace plus 30, 60, 90 ... days) of the figure plus the charges of the boundaries before it (compounding), each
    67	     *  rounded to two decimals as the claim rounds (see Rounding), the charges added up (a boundary whose percent is 0.00 adds nothing); 0.00 when it is not
