9	 *  they have any hold, their dated grades, earliest first, and their holds in the order they were put on (their OPEN
10	 *  claims dated within one, not bound by a statement, count in no live total), their own terms in days in force on the sheet's today (null: none), their contact (trimmed, lower-cased; null: none), their aliases, sorted as names are compared, and whether their name or an alias is also used on another
11	 *  sheet of the sheet's tree (its ancestors and descendants), the sheet they were last transferred from (null:
